## Key Decisions Locked (S153)
- 6-state machine: Needs Info → Awaiting Tenant → Ready to Schedule → Scheduled → In Progress → Complete
- woType = field (not status): maintenance | turnover | inspection
- missingFields[] drives Needs Info sub-labels + "Request Info" suggested actions
- Awaiting Tenant: CC auto-sends SMS + email with scheduling link (date + arrival window)
- Arrival windows: morning | afternoon | late_afternoon (not exact times)
- Dispatcher confirms after tenant proposes (never auto-schedules)
- Two reschedule paths: internal field update OR tenant re-coordination → Awaiting Tenant
- 21-day auto-drop replaces Archived status
- domain/ directory: ESLint-enforced boundary, DAL injection, narrow public API via index.ts
- ADR count: 14

